	(text_box "CARRIER REQUIREMENT:\nJ402 PS_MIO signals are 3.3V I/O on this SoM.\nCarrier SD/USB-ULPI/UART/I2C/QSPI-side devices and pull-ups must use compatible 3.3V I/O.\nI2C0_SCL/SDA pull-ups are not populated on the SoM; provide them on the carrier if used."
